<title>THAILAND: Tipco Asphalt first quarter net jumps.</title>
<headline>Tipco Asphalt first quarter net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     2.15	 vs		1.29</p>
<p>    Net		    237.05	 vs	    130.69</p>
<p>Notes: Results are for Tipco Asphalt Plc and its subsidiaries. Company distributes and produces asphalt.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
